## Troubleshooting Workers

### Common Issues

| Issue | Cause | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
| Worker not picking up tasks | Wrong task queue | Verify task queue name |
| High memory usage | Too many concurrent activities | Reduce concurrency |
| Tasks timing out | Insufficient workers | Scale up workers |
| Connection errors | Network issues | Check connectivity |
| Worker crashes | Unhandled exceptions | Add error handling |

